### Health
GET http://127.0.0.1:7002/health

### Agent card
GET http://127.0.0.1:7002/.well-known/agent-card.json

### List MCP tools
POST http://127.0.0.1:7002/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":"1","method":"tools/list"}

### MCP: check stock for product 1
POST http://127.0.0.1:7002/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":"2","method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"mcp_check_stock","arguments":{"product_id":1}}}

### A2A: assess order inventory - sync (SendMessage)
# Sends a structured order event to the agent for inventory assessment.
# The agent will reserve stock and create a reorder proposal if stock is low.
POST http://127.0.0.1:7002/
Content-Type: application/json
A2A-Version: 1.0

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": "1",
  "method": "SendMessage",
  "params": {
    "message": {
      "messageId": "msg-001",
      "role": "ROLE_USER",
      "parts": [
        {
          "text": "{\"orderId\":\"order-123\",\"correlationId\":\"corr-1\",\"items\":[{\"productId\":1,\"quantity\":2,\"price\":10.0}]}"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}

### A2A: assess order inventory - streaming SSE (SendStreamingMessage)
POST http://127.0.0.1:7002/
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream
A2A-Version: 1.0

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": "2",
  "method": "SendStreamingMessage",
  "params": {
    "message": {
      "messageId": "msg-002",
      "role": "ROLE_USER",
      "parts": [
        {
          "text": "{\"orderId\":\"order-456\",\"correlationId\":\"corr-2\",\"items\":[{\"productId\":1,\"quantity\":3,\"price\":10.0}]}"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
